[2026-03-04T20:07:51.636Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012BcyZmNrKdFi6frwYnSbba","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary: Todo App - Complete Project Overview\n\nI've thoroughly explored the codebase and found the app being built. Here's a comprehensive report:\n\n### 1. APP BEING BUILT\n**App Name:** `todo-app`\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/todo-app`\n\n### 2. KEY DOCUMENTATION FILES FOUND\n\n**AppSpec.md** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/AppSpec.md`)\n- Complete app specification with pages, components, data model, and API endpoints\n- Defines 2 pages: Main Todo List Page and Edit Todo Modal\n- Outlines 7 main components to build\n\n**docs/tests.md** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/docs/tests.md`)\n- Comprehensive Playwright test specification with 54+ test cases\n- Organized by component: Header, AddTodo, TodoList, FilterBar, SortDropdown, EditTodoModal\n- Tests cover filtering, sorting, CRUD operations, validation, and persistence\n\n**NO AppRevisions.md** - Does not exist yet\n\n**NO AppStyle.md files** - Neither at `/repo/apps/AppStyle.md` nor `/repo/apps/todo-app/AppStyle.md`\n\n**NO apps/shared/ directory** - Does not exist\n\n### 3. TECHNOLOGY STACK (from AGENTS.md)\n- **Build Tool:** Vite\n- **Language:** TypeScript (strict mode)\n- **Frontend:** React 18 with Redux for state management\n- **UI Components:** shadcn/ui\n- **Database:** Neon (PostgreSQL)\n- **Backend:** Netlify Functions (serverless)\n- **File Storage:** UploadThing (optional)\n\n### 4. APP STRUCTURE & PAGES TO BUILD\n\n**Main Todo List Page (`/`)**\n- **Components needed:**\n  - Header (app title, incomplete count)\n  - AddTodo (input field)\n  - TodoList (list of todos with interactive elements)\n  - FilterBar (All/Active/Completed filters + Clear Completed button)\n  - SortDropdown (sort by: Newest First, Oldest First, Priority, Due Date)\n  - TodoItem (part of TodoList with checkbox, text, priority badge, due date, delete button)\n\n**Edit Todo Modal**\n- Opens when clicking a todo item's text\n- Fields: Title (required), Priority (dropdown), Due Date (date picker), Notes (textarea)\n- Actions: Save, Cancel buttons + click-outside-to-close\n\n### 5. DATABASE SCHEMA REQUIRED\n\nSingle `todos` table with:\n- `id` (UUID, primary key)\n- `title` (TEXT, required)\n- `completed` (BOOLEAN)\n- `priority` (TEXT: \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\")\n- `due_date` (DATE, optional)\n- `notes` (TEXT, optional)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n- `updated_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n### 6. API ENDPOINTS NEEDED\n\n- `GET /.netlify/functions/todos` - Get all todos\n- `POST /.netlify/functions/todos` - Create new todo\n- `PUT /.netlify/functions/todos/:id` - Update todo\n- `DELETE /.netlify/functions/todos/:id` - Delete todo\n- `DELETE /.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true` - Clear all completed todos\n\n### 7. EXISTING FILES IN TODO-APP DIRECTORY\n\n```\n/repo/apps/todo-app/\n├── AppSpec.md (3,406 bytes)\n└── docs/\n    └── tests.md (23,763 bytes - detailed test specifications)\n```\n\n**Status:** Only specification and test files exist. NO implementation files yet.\n\n### 8. NO EXISTING COMPONENTS, PAGES, OR FUNCTIONS\n\n- No React components written yet\n- No pages implemented yet\n- No Netlify functions written yet\n- No database schema initialized yet\n- No package.json or app configuration yet\n- No src/ or netlify/ directories exist in todo-app\n\n### 9. RELEVANT SKILL FILES FOR APP BUILDING\n\nLocated at `/repo/skills/tasks/build/`:\n- `writeApp.md` - Guidelines for building the app (10,600 bytes) - **Main skill for component development**\n- `writeTests.md` - Guidelines for writing Playwright tests\n- `testing.md` - Guidelines for test execution\n- `testSpec.md` - Guidelines for test spec creation\n- `writeShared.md` - Guidelines for shared code\n\n### 10. KEY DIRECTIVES FROM writeApp.md\n\n- Must have `initSchema` function exported from app's `scripts/schema.ts`\n- Run `npm run check` from app directory (not root)\n- Add `data-testid` attributes to interactive elements for E2E testing\n- Use CSS files with style variables instead of hardcoded styles\n- All components need their own files (no inline JSX in pages)\n- Add `base = \"apps/todo-app\"` to netlify.toml\n- Create shared `netlify/functions/db.ts` for database access\n- Use only tagged template literals for SQL queries\n- Every page must have consistent padding: `p-6 max-sm:p-3`\n\n### 11. ROOT PROJECT STRUCTURE\n\n```\n/repo/\n├── AGENTS.md - Agent behavior guidelines\n├── CLAUDE.md - Brief reference (points to AGENTS.md)\n├── README.md - Platform overview\n├── AGENTS.md - Comprehensive platform documentation\n├── apps/ - App directories (only todo-app exists)\n├── skills/ - Agent skill guides\n│   ├── tasks/build/ - App building skills\n│   ├── tasks/ - Task execution skills\n│   ├── messages/ - Message handling skills\n│   ├── scripts/ - Script execution skills\n│   ├── debugging/ - Debugging guides\n│   └── review/ - Review and analysis skills\n├── src/ - Agent source code (not app code)\n├── tasks/ - Task queue management\n└── scripts/ - Utility scripts\n```\n\n### 12. NO ADDITIONAL DOCUMENTATION\n\n- No `/repo/docs/tests.md` at repo root level\n- No global AppStyle.md or style guide documents\n- No existing shared component library\n- No reusable patterns documentation beyond the skills\n\nAll files and directories are confirmed through thorough exploration using find, ls, and directory listing commands."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ab5ccf6c1e2b145a0 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 38110\ntool_uses: 43\nduration_ms: 43444</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c97f9f9-38f7-47f6-b325-4f48ece0a82a","uuid":"4850d547-1eb3-4b14-8c46-7232812aab75","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the app being built. Look for:\n1. The task file in tasks/ directory to find the app name\n2. AppSpec.md in the apps/ directory\n3. AppRevisions.md if it exists\n4. Style guides at apps/AppStyle.md and apps/<AppName>/AppStyle.md\n5. docs/tests.md\n6. Any existing files in the app directory (list all)\n7. apps/shared/ directory contents\n8. Any existing components, pages, netlify functions already written\n\nBe very thorough - list all files found.","agentId":"ab5ccf6c1e2b145a0","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary: Todo App - Complete Project Overview\n\nI've thoroughly explored the codebase and found the app being built. Here's a comprehensive report:\n\n### 1. APP BEING BUILT\n**App Name:** `todo-app`\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/todo-app`\n\n### 2. KEY DOCUMENTATION FILES FOUND\n\n**AppSpec.md** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/AppSpec.md`)\n- Complete app specification with pages, components, data model, and API endpoints\n- Defines 2 pages: Main Todo List Page and Edit Todo Modal\n- Outlines 7 main components to build\n\n**docs/tests.md** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/docs/tests.md`)\n- Comprehensive Playwright test specification with 54+ test cases\n- Organized by component: Header, AddTodo, TodoList, FilterBar, SortDropdown, EditTodoModal\n- Tests cover filtering, sorting, CRUD operations, validation, and persistence\n\n**NO AppRevisions.md** - Does not exist yet\n\n**NO AppStyle.md files** - Neither at `/repo/apps/AppStyle.md` nor `/repo/apps/todo-app/AppStyle.md`\n\n**NO apps/shared/ directory** - Does not exist\n\n### 3. TECHNOLOGY STACK (from AGENTS.md)\n- **Build Tool:** Vite\n- **Language:** TypeScript (strict mode)\n- **Frontend:** React 18 with Redux for state management\n- **UI Components:** shadcn/ui\n- **Database:** Neon (PostgreSQL)\n- **Backend:** Netlify Functions (serverless)\n- **File Storage:** UploadThing (optional)\n\n### 4. APP STRUCTURE & PAGES TO BUILD\n\n**Main Todo List Page (`/`)**\n- **Components needed:**\n  - Header (app title, incomplete count)\n  - AddTodo (input field)\n  - TodoList (list of todos with interactive elements)\n  - FilterBar (All/Active/Completed filters + Clear Completed button)\n  - SortDropdown (sort by: Newest First, Oldest First, Priority, Due Date)\n  - TodoItem (part of TodoList with checkbox, text, priority badge, due date, delete button)\n\n**Edit Todo Modal**\n- Opens when clicking a todo item's text\n- Fields: Title (required), Priority (dropdown), Due Date (date picker), Notes (textarea)\n- Actions: Save, Cancel buttons + click-outside-to-close\n\n### 5. DATABASE SCHEMA REQUIRED\n\nSingle `todos` table with:\n- `id` (UUID, primary key)\n- `title` (TEXT, required)\n- `completed` (BOOLEAN)\n- `priority` (TEXT: \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\")\n- `due_date` (DATE, optional)\n- `notes` (TEXT, optional)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n- `updated_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n### 6. API ENDPOINTS NEEDED\n\n- `GET /.netlify/functions/todos` - Get all todos\n- `POST /.netlify/functions/todos` - Create new todo\n- `PUT /.netlify/functions/todos/:id` - Update todo\n- `DELETE /.netlify/functions/todos/:id` - Delete todo\n- `DELETE /.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true` - Clear all completed todos\n\n### 7. EXISTING FILES IN TODO-APP DIRECTORY\n\n```\n/repo/apps/todo-app/\n├── AppSpec.md (3,406 bytes)\n└── docs/\n    └── tests.md (23,763 bytes - detailed test specifications)\n```\n\n**Status:** Only specification and test files exist. NO implementation files yet.\n\n### 8. NO EXISTING COMPONENTS, PAGES, OR FUNCTIONS\n\n- No React components written yet\n- No pages implemented yet\n- No Netlify functions written yet\n- No database schema initialized yet\n- No package.json or app configuration yet\n- No src/ or netlify/ directories exist in todo-app\n\n### 9. RELEVANT SKILL FILES FOR APP BUILDING\n\nLocated at `/repo/skills/tasks/build/`:\n- `writeApp.md` - Guidelines for building the app (10,600 bytes) - **Main skill for component development**\n- `writeTests.md` - Guidelines for writing Playwright tests\n- `testing.md` - Guidelines for test execution\n- `testSpec.md` - Guidelines for test spec creation\n- `writeShared.md` - Guidelines for shared code\n\n### 10. KEY DIRECTIVES FROM writeApp.md\n\n- Must have `initSchema` function exported from app's `scripts/schema.ts`\n- Run `npm run check` from app directory (not root)\n- Add `data-testid` attributes to interactive elements for E2E testing\n- Use CSS files with style variables instead of hardcoded styles\n- All components need their own files (no inline JSX in pages)\n- Add `base = \"apps/todo-app\"` to netlify.toml\n- Create shared `netlify/functions/db.ts` for database access\n- Use only tagged template literals for SQL queries\n- Every page must have consistent padding: `p-6 max-sm:p-3`\n\n### 11. ROOT PROJECT STRUCTURE\n\n```\n/repo/\n├── AGENTS.md - Agent behavior guidelines\n├── CLAUDE.md - Brief reference (points to AGENTS.md)\n├── README.md - Platform overview\n├── AGENTS.md - Comprehensive platform documentation\n├── apps/ - App directories (only todo-app exists)\n├── skills/ - Agent skill guides\n│   ├── tasks/build/ - App building skills\n│   ├── tasks/ - Task execution skills\n│   ├── messages/ - Message handling skills\n│   ├── scripts/ - Script execution skills\n│   ├── debugging/ - Debugging guides\n│   └── review/ - Review and analysis skills\n├── src/ - Agent source code (not app code)\n├── tasks/ - Task queue management\n└── scripts/ - Utility scripts\n```\n\n### 12. NO ADDITIONAL DOCUMENTATION\n\n- No `/repo/docs/tests.md` at repo root level\n- No global AppStyle.md or style guide documents\n- No existing shared component library\n- No reusable patterns documentation beyond the skills\n\nAll files and directories are confirmed through thorough exploration using find, ls, and directory listing commands."}],"totalDurationMs":43444,"totalTokens":38110,"totalToolUseCount":43,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":806,"cache_read_input_tokens":35810,"output_tokens":1489,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":806},"i